OL,3,GNEWSAPlans being developed for new
OL,4,Acollege in city
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans are being drawn up to create a
OL,7,Fnew college in Derby to train engineers
OL,8,Fand skilled industrial workers.
OL,10,FOfficials have earmarked Lonsdale House
OL,11,Fin Lodge Lane to become a new campus
OL,12,Ffor 16 to 18-year-olds, which will be
OL,13,Fled by the University of Derby, the
OL,14,FLocal Democracy Reporting Service said.
OL,16,FThe plan is to provide future talent
OL,17,Ffor Derby's key sectors of aerospace,
OL,18,Frail, nuclear, advanced manufacturing
OL,19,Fand clean energy.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
